lesson.example:
A Cedar-style rule for refunds:
permit(principal in Role::"SupportAgent", action == Action::"Refund", resource) when { resource.amount <= 200 };
A second policy routes amounts over 200 to approval. Testing: refunds of 150 → allow, 200 → allow, 201 → approval, any amount by a non-support principal → deny (Cedar denies by default when no permit matches).
